From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] canaan-ws2812: add the k230 i2s ws2812 led driver

Add a driver for a chain of WS2812 RGB LEDs on the K230 I2S0
transmitter, compatible canaan,i2s-ws2812. The driver encodes the G-R-B
bit stream as I2S words and sends it through the peripheral DMA
controller. It has no PIO path, so the device needs its DMA channel.
Userspace writes the LED colours through the misc device /dev/ws2812.

